#N Twin bees shuttle
#O Bill Gosper, 1971
#C Two small active regions (the twin bees) bounce back and forth between
#C block stabilisers; this period-46 shuttle is the engine of the classic
#C p46 guns.
#C Verified by the Emergence Lab verifier (B3/S23, unbounded grid):
#C oscillator, period 46.
